5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. I would like to look into the winter road closures north of the river and the bus links in the two outer wards. I want to ensure our neighbors can always reach us.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I will examine the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, as well as the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. I wish to understand how our patrons currently access our resources.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops! I bet there are cool secrets in the old files that we forgot about.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. I suspect the structural shape of our funding may be more problematic than its volume.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will review the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I want to see if we have the actual skills on hand to support new initiatives.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
